 text-sm mb-4\">Prefer names of a specific length? Find short and sweet or longer distinctive names:</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a class=\"bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/length/3/albatross/\">3<!-- --> Letters</a><a class=\"bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/length/4/albatross/\">4<!-- --> Letters</a><a class=\"bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/length/5/albatross/\">5<!-- --> Letters</a><a class=\"bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/length/6/albatross/\">6<!-- --> Letters</a><a class=\"bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/length/7/albatross/\">7<!-- --> Letters</a><a class=\"bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/length/8/albatross/\">8<!-- --> Letters</a><a class=\"bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/length/9/albatross/\">9<!-- --> Letters</a><a class=\"bg-gray-50 hover:bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" href=\"/length/10/albatross/\">10<!-- --> Letters</a></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-gray-400 py-10\" aria-label=\"Site footer\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8\"><div><h4 class